1630 0 obj
  << /ActualText (VibeSit Insight was built in SwiftUI\054 with a MongoDB backend accessed via an authenticated REST API\056 We used a cloud macOS environment \050RentAMac\051 was provisioned to give all developers remote access to Xcode where code was simulated on a virtual iPad\056)
     /K [ 11 ]
     /P 1631 0 R
     /Pg 1608 0 R
     /S /Span
     /Type /StructElem
  >>
