1632 0 obj
  << /ActualText (VibeTeam redesigned the companion iPad application for the VibeTech VT3 into VibeSit Insight\054 a Swift\057SwiftUI platform that guides patients and clinicians through a complete rehabilitation program\056 The application delivers adaptive check\055in surveys\054 standardized clinical tests for balance\054 mobility\054 and strength\054 a composite scoring system\054 and a progress dashboard\056)
     /K [ 12 ]
     /P 1633 0 R
     /Pg 1608 0 R
     /S /Span
     /Type /StructElem
  >>
endobj

1633 0 obj
  << /K [ 1632 0 R ]
     /P 1704 0 R
     /S /P
     /Pg 1608 0 R
     /Type /StructElem
  >>
endobj

1634 0 obj
  << /ActualText (The VibeSit Insight software stack connects a SwiftUI iPad application to a Python Flask REST API via a secure ngrok tunnel\054 transmitting authenticated user survey\054 session\054 and assessment data using HTTPS and JWT Bearer tokens\056 All patient records\054 treatment configurations\054 and progress metrics are persisted in a MongoDB database\054 which the app queries in real time to populate the Dashboard and Profile pages throughout the treatment lifecycle\056)
     /K [ 13 ]
     /P 1635 0 R
     /Pg 1608 0 R
     /S /Span
     /Type /StructElem
  >>
endobj

1635 0 obj
  << /K [ 1634 0 R ]
     /P 1704 0 R
