1638 0 obj
  << /ActualText (Lower\055limb rehabilitation is essential for patients recovering from surgery\054 managing chronic conditions\054 or facing age\055related declines in strength and mobility\054 yet existing tools rarely provide the infrastructure to objectively track outcomes over time\056 The VibeTech VT3 device delivers resistance and vibration therapy while measuring force and repetitions\054 but its original software lacked a structured workflow and centralized data collection\054 leaving progress scattered across paper forms\054 spreadsheets\054 and clinician notes\056 A redesigned application was needed to bridge the gap between a capable physical therapy device and the clinical workflows required to make its data actionable\056)
     /K [ 15 ]
     /P 1639 0 R
     /Pg 1608 0 R
     /S /Span
     /Type /StructElem
  >>
endobj

1639 0 obj
  << /K [ 1638 0 R ]
     /P 1704 0 R
