1650 0 obj
  << /ActualText (The system\047s functionality was tested by simulating therapy sessions to ensure proper workflow performance and data accuracy\056 Each data point entered through the app was verified to have a 1\0721 match in the MongoDB backend\054 confirming that every survey response\054 assessment result\054 and session metric was captured\054 stored\054 and retrievable as expected\056 The testing proved that treatment plans and assessments were scheduled appropriately\054 session information was correctly recorded\054 and data reports were consistently generated from the dashboard\056)
     /K [ 21 ]
     /P 1651 0 R
     /Pg 1608 0 R
     /S /Span
