1686 0 obj
  << /ActualText (VibeSit Insight transforms the VT3 from a standalone therapy device into a complete clinical platform\056\n\nPatients gain an accessible interface designed for elderly users\054 with adaptive surveys that reduce repetitive data entry\054 session\055by\055session progress visualization\054 and a dashboard that makes their rehabilitation journey tangible and motivating\056\n\nClinicians gain standardized\054 SPPB\055aligned assessments\054 configurable treatment timelines\054 and measurable longitudinal outcomes\054 replacing spreadsheets with a centralized\054 objective data pipeline that supports confident treatment decisions\056)
     /K [ 39 ]
     /P 1687 0 R
     /Pg 1608 0 R
     /S /Span
     /Type /StructElem
  >>
